'''Gunduros''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS (Gacha Event)|Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS]] event. It was added in [[Version 13.5 Update|Version 13.5]].

