==Trivia==
*Since several of the other [[Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS (Gacha Event)|Dragon Emperors]] appear to have been named after video games, particularly shooter games like ''[[wikipedia:Raiden (video game)|Raiden]]'', ''[[wikipedia:Gradius|Gradius]]'' and ''[[wikipedia:Darius|Darius]]'', Gunduros (ガンドロス ''Gandorosu'') may be a reference to ''[[wikipedia:Blazing Lazers|Blazing Lazers]]'', which is known as ''Gunhed'' (ガンヘッド ''Ganheddo'') in Japan. Its name could also be derived from the movie ''[[wikipedia:ja:ガンドレス|GUNDRESS]]'' (ガンドレス ''Gandoresu''), the Greek island [[wikipedia:Folegandros|Folegandros]] (フォレガンドロス ''Foregandorosu''), the Pokémon [[bulbapedia:Landorus (Pokémon)|Landorus]] (ランドロス ''Randorosu''), or the [[wikia:gundam:Dolos-class|Dolos-class]] (ドロス級 ''Dorosu-kyū'') from ''[[wikipedia:Mobile Suit Gundam|Mobile Suit Gundam]]''.

